{"skill":{"slug":"golang-coding","displayName":"code-score"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773735639232,"changelog":"Initial release of golang-coding skill.\n\n- First public version (v1.0.0).\n- Provides foundational support for Go (Golang) coding tasks.\n- Ready for general use.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"config.md","size":5687,"sha256":"46724ffa064111406fc7d5df6632ad64c2e3ac5b4e89afdb5822393534a72553","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":5367,"sha256":"191688bdbb72a59f9714fd08ada75a0f35c2fade9ca3a5643351f48e858627f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"README.md","size":6655,"sha256":"19dd375e4dc24e13f970d56a915ab45b747f63e7d8e45524bd137d48d28aab57","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1686,"sha256":"8e9b1e2e126a3361077784e2fe8fb36ba5bf0f7d95617d480060d127a8b36e91","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789185919201,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"3afe312519767356a8670bbd76dfb1de25ead08a8253ab7c8e2eb3ac5446c7b5","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/3afe312519767356a8670bbd76dfb1de25ead08a8253ab7c8e2eb3ac5446c7b5","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780089933138},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":15,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"SAFE","issueCount":3,"checkedAt":1789185919201},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"The package presents its skill instructions, README, and configuration as Markdown, but they are opaque binary data, so the skill's behavior cannot be reviewed.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Because all user-facing and configuration artifacts are unreadable, there is no coherent basis to judge whether any environment access would be proportionate.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"No executable installer was observed, but the README and config files are also opaque binary data, leaving setup requirements and runtime configuration undisclosed.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The primary instructions are not auditable, so tool use, data handling, external interactions, and user-control boundaries cannot be validated.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"I found no readable evidence of persistence, privilege escalation, exfiltration, or destructive behavior, but the opaque files prevent confirming their absence.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No readable purpose or capability description is present; artifact/SKILL.md is binary data rather than valid UTF-8 Markdown instructions.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Do not install this version unless the publisher replaces the opaque files with complete plain-text, reviewable instructions and configuration, or provides a documented decoder and reviewed canonical content digest.","findings":"[AE2] unexpected: Verified: README.md, SKILL.md, and config.md are reported as data files, fail UTF-8 decoding at byte 0, and contain NUL-padded/non-text bytes rather than Markdown.\n[other] unexpected: The static scan's obfuscated-content concern is supported by artifact inspection; however, no decoded payload or concrete execution, network, credential, persistence, or destructive behavior was recovered.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789185919201}}}}}